{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-2-2-3:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_2_2_3\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_2_2_3:competitor-overview:01\",\n      \"text\": \"同类药物研究概述：本章的同类药物/竞品证据应仅用于总结同类靶点或机制的既有研究，并应与本药临床证据分别标注来源；同类药物证据不得用于形成本药临床结论。已确认的对照信息为：对照为安慰剂（生理盐水1.0 mL，皮下注射；与试验药物同体积、同途径、同频率给药）。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_2_2_3:own-clinical-evidence:02\",\n      \"text\": \"本药临床证据：研究药物为首次概念验证开发，临床证据见非临床研究章节。涉及本药的临床证据应独立于同类药物证据登记和表述，不得以同类药物数据替代本药临床结果。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_2_2_3:own-clinical-context:03\",\n      \"text\": \"本药临床研究上下文：本研究为合成药X在成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉患者中的Ⅱ期概念验证研究，采用随机双盲、安慰剂对照设计。本药临床结果应随上述研究阶段、研究设计和研究人群上下文一并呈现，不得借用同类药物段落替代该上下文。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"80e6d29a863f02c11e0086b8965b3d5093c9adb5630a7ee01271e27c874a43a7"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:4d116b17cf97a15f03c8a669d2a715da324840849e373ac9de803ba82ac0a2e9:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:4d116b17cf97a15f03c8a669d2a715da324840849e373ac9de803ba82ac0a2e9:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"efdf4a08b4fed92ff9ba27c257eb8ee053f11f0ad6f3c5bb45a8c8b021d53a72","prompt_sha256":"9aec0ea7a8d8361fdb1c273790e20e30d5e6b1d7680ac1c6c63436bd71300fac","provider_session_id":"a8edd39c-7815-40b6-8afa-37460423361d","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_respon